<title>USA: Meadow Valley names Gary Burnell CFO.</title>
<headline>Meadow Valley names Gary Burnell CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meadow Valley Corp said Thursday Gary Burnell vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer, effective April 1.</p>
<p>Burnell replaces Kenneth Nelson, a director of the company, who has been named to the new position of vice president - corporate administration.</p>
<p>Burnell, 50, was formerly chief financial officer at TEMPO Enterprises Inc from January 1987 until the company was acquired by Tele-Communications Inc in December 1988, according to Meadow Valley Corp.</p>
